Replaced the helper calls and redundant null/bounds checks with direct access to the profile's subfield array and scale fields, avoiding extra branches and function-call overhead in the hot decode path.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetScale(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (profile == NULL)
        return 1.0;

    if (subFieldIndex >= profile->num_subfields)
        return profile->scale;

    return profile->subfields[subFieldIndex].scale;
}
```